From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Levi Zim <rsworktech@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: add linux riscv64 build target

Registers riscv64 as a Linux architecture across the gulp packaging pipeline (deb/rpm arch maps, generated dependency lists, sysroot download), the CLI update-service platform detection, the REH requirement check, and the extension gallery TargetPlatform, so VSCodium can produce riscv64 desktop and remote builds (#1851, #1922).

Co-authored-by: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>

